{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pulls/2885","id":4917035745,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTrgxoM8AAAABJRQC4Q","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/2885","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/2885.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/2885.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/issues/2885","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pulls/2885/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pulls/2885/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/issues/2885/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/statuses/43a638d4e25ebc5a8b06babcd1c75c9acac53179","number":2885,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"ui: integrate the shared Rust Robrix surface and bounded gateway on main","user":{"login":"Franksudoman","id":273670192,"node_id":"U_kgDOEE_gMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273670192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman","html_url":"https://github.com/Franksudoman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\n\nThe reviewed Rust Robrix UI exists on the older #1418/#1423 stack, while current main does not expose that complete shared interaction surface. Importing the whole stack would also bring unrelated Fleet, Memory, global workflow and backend dependency changes. This PR ports the UI and its narrow gateway boundary onto the actual current main.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Import the existing shared Rust chat renderer and Console tab, responsive layouts, strict-CSP Makepad WASM build, CJK resources, immutable manifest and the reviewed #2884 font transport fix.\n- Expose the verified UI bundle through the existing bounded loopback gateway. Read-only status uses a weak reference to the original owner; unavailable owners produce an explicit unavailable state. The UI does not create an owner, issuer or effect authority.\n- Preserve main backend Rust **1.95.0** and all **1,517 resolved package version/source/checksum records**. Cargo.lock adds only the existing rustix 1.1.4, serde and sha2 0.10.9 dependency edges to the gateway package.\n- Run unchanged browser assertions with one worker on the shared software-GL runner; retain all six default cases and three engines.\n- Add source-head and independently constructed base-merge UI validation, plus a separate temporary job running the original `just bazel-lock-update` and original lock drift check. The actual generated lock must be reviewed and committed before merging.\n\n## Source identity\n\n- Actual main parent: `f8c9419df6ddeb36ff8b522a50219981fb8d9345`.\n- Published head: `85c03628f108290a02ae1ee48a6b5711352cbc38`.\n- Exact source tree: `2f1234386c0b07b8ab5c5048216f7c80085afa51`.\n- Independently assembled local commit: `e501875c2689792f26beeef36e615e0c16e3a85d`, identical tree.\n- Reviewed import: #2884 `ec1ab573a68d383cca4b42826a59e2e2a5c34882`; 172 blobs are reused verbatim, and the 40 adapted/generated source blobs were hash-verified during publication.\n- Detailed module and implementation notes: `apps/hepta-control-ui/MAIN_INTEGRATION.md` and `docs/modules/ui.control/technical.md`.\n\n## Validation and open acceptance\n\nThe local source/format checks, builder pin regressions and synthetic merge regressions completed. The final workflow YAML and 25 Bash blocks parsed. Earlier #2884 has separately bound actual Rust/browser evidence, including native Rust font consumption; those results do not qualify this new main integration.\n\nThis candidate still requires its own actual Rust build/tests, all source and merge browser assertions, and a real reviewed Bazel lock. The observed Firefox WebGL2 startup failure and Chromium no-store stream completion issue remain visible; worker serialization is a candidate resource fix and does not turn an old failed run green.\n\nActual owner attachment, production issuer/FinalUse/effect delivery and desktop/mobile device qualification remain separate work. This PR does not change those acceptance boundaries or waive original blocking/security checks.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-19T06:49:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T07:38:57Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8666cc01c5f72eec7f09c5ab044c417cb97d52ba","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TrillionniumFoundation:agents/a00-ui-main-20261019","ref":"agents/a00-ui-main-20261019","repo":{"id":1320694176,"node_id":"R_kgDOTrgxoA","name":"hepta-private-ci","full_name":"TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci","owner":{"login":"TrillionniumFoundation","id":262513357,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6WizQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262513357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation",